WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:08.000
SCP-682 Vs SCP-063. The Hard to Destroy Reptile&nbsp;
faced the ultimate weapon - A toothbrush known&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.160
as “The World’s Best Toothbrush” which&nbsp;
can cleave through any physical matter.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:17.040
The Foundation used a robotic arm to attack 682&nbsp;
with the toothbrush, scrubbing out 20% of its&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:22.720
body before it began regenerating. However, the&nbsp;
regenerated matter seemed to be immune to 063, and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:27.840
682 then attacked and destroyed the robotic arm.
063 scrubbed its way through the ground and out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:32.320
of the containment chamber. 682 grew a long,&nbsp;
prehensile arm that slithered down through&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:37.280
the hole, and killed two researchers.&nbsp;
063 was later covered without incident.

